                        ],
                        "form": "sous-espèces"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9d81991-b7ad-3637-875a-aabc4e825f66",
                        "entry_id": "ba6fd5cf-0f1f-33b1-88cc-17445faf60d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Division dans une espèce."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Classification phylogénétique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8f795f5-7967-44bc-806c-034a6645c04a",
                                "sense_id": "b9d81991-b7ad-3637-875a-aabc4e825f66",
                                "text": "Les trois sous-espèces sembleraient plutôt résulter de l'éclatement d'un syngaméon et c'est pourquoi nous avons adopté le traitement taxonomique de MAIRE (1959)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff96be64-7b3a-4ea1-9c66-f0ce169a6b33",
                                "sense_id": "b9d81991-b7ad-3637-875a-aabc4e825f66",
                                "text": "Les noms étant une espèce de mot, les noms propres, les noms communs, les noms collectifs et les noms partitifs en sont les sous-espèces."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2db58d7a-b5ad-3548-9c43-dd401b6be4e6",
                        "entry_id": "ba6fd5cf-0f1f-33b1-88cc-17445faf60d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "En histoire naturelle, nom donné aux collections d’individus qui diffèrent dans les mêmes rapports que les variétés et races, mais d’une manière caractéristique et très prononcée, de telle sorte que les différences se perpétuent dans toutes les circonstances où les individus choisis comme types de l’espèce peuvent vivre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "125e9eb3-9fb7-4e3b-8457-bee6b6c17345",
                        "source_entry_id": "ba6fd5cf-0f1f-33b1-88cc-17445faf60d7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Division dans une espèce",
                        "target_lang_word": "Unterart",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Unterart",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59edc6c2-87ae-3bce-8152-7651a09adfda",
                                        "entry_id": "dc8b0d82-ea45-3511-885a-89f492e9424d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in der biologischen Systematik die Rangstufe direkt unterhalb der Art"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eedcb42d-6c4a-435f-b159-23e6138d2527",
                                                "sense_id": "59edc6c2-87ae-3bce-8152-7651a09adfda",
                                                "text": "Der Grizzlybär (Ursus arctos horribilis) ist eine in Nordamerika lebende Unterart des Braunbären."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "701e2159-2155-47af-8906-140ee8b6a04a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ba6fd5cf-0f1f-33b1-88cc-17445faf60d7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Division dans une espèce",
                        "target_lang_word": "Subspezies",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Subspezies",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "665ddbd6-45ee-3f4d-802f-18e7107cdd58",
                                        "entry_id": "e2985eb9-7791-372b-aea3-a203f1201834",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine meist geografisch abgegrenzte differenzierte Ausbildung einer Spezies"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "jargon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "134c3f96-907c-4ee5-9743-0d3c47529b95",
                                                "sense_id": "665ddbd6-45ee-3f4d-802f-18e7107cdd58",
                                                "text": "„Eine Subspezies ist die Zusammenfassung phänotypisch ähnlicher Populationen einer Art, die ein geographisches Teilgebiet des Areals der Art bewohnen und sich taxonomisch von anderen Populationen der Art unterscheiden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6069ca5e-cd89-42ba-8fc6-5b84c13fe73a",
                                                "sense_id": "665ddbd6-45ee-3f4d-802f-18e7107cdd58",
                                                "text": "„Die Entwicklungsgeschichte des modernen Menschen ist mit rund 160000 Jahren schlicht zu kurz, um voneinander unterscheidbare Subspezies hervorzubringen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9299bac3-f5d2-4587-9a46-ed568fababce",
                        "source_entry_id": "ba6fd5cf-0f1f-33b1-88cc-17445faf60d7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Division dans une espèce",
                        "target_lang_word": "subspecies",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "subspecies",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb8cb168-794c-3b1f-8955-f4e23c19158f",
                                        "entry_id": "c0403306-4163-37b8-baec-8f9d3e412327",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rank in the classification of organisms, below species."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66bfb42b-72a5-4456-9ded-ee14a93983ef",
                                                "sense_id": "fb8cb168-794c-3b1f-8955-f4e23c19158f",
                                                "text": "I believe it [the trilobite Calymene blumenbachii] has been divided into several forms, which cannot claim more than the rank of subspecies, as they pass by slight gradations into forms which no author has yet thought it right to separate from the type species."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57dc5ba2-8210-4572-82d1-3e4f23f5b182",
                                                "sense_id": "fb8cb168-794c-3b1f-8955-f4e23c19158f",
                                                "text": "Ant taxonomists have decided that anything that's worth separating should be separated at the species level, and have no truck with subspecies at all. Butterfly taxonomists, however, like the triple-barrelled name approach and dote on subspecies. As a result, the numbers of ant species and butterfly species are not directly comparable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "530c7a4c-4ad4-3e21-a6b6-4a4e2ed04a03",
                                        "entry_id": "c0403306-4163-37b8-baec-8f9d3e412327",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A taxon at that rank, often indicated with trinomial nomenclature (such as Felis silvestris silvestris in zoology and Pinus nigra subsp. salzmannii in botany)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8b2b408-3153-47b0-b17b-cc1e1c70bceb",
                                                "sense_id": "530c7a4c-4ad4-3e21-a6b6-4a4e2ed04a03",
                                                "text": "But these slight differences will not justify us in considering the West African chiquera as a true species distinct from the Indian true chiquera; it is only a subspecies of the latter true species."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bf84636-dbeb-3eee-9dd7-cef016efcbc2",
                                        "entry_id": "c0403306-4163-37b8-baec-8f9d3e412327",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subdivision of a species in other scientific disciplines."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0642df0f-6a6d-4002-b366-dba4d8b95e7e",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf84636-dbeb-3eee-9dd7-cef016efcbc2",
                                                "text": "Granular Augite. […] This subspecies of augite has been hitherto found principally in primitive rocks at Arendal in Norway, in several of the iron-mines, particularly that named Ulve-Grube."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07f255d2-485b-43e0-9926-77a81fff3f4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "ba6fd5cf-0f1f-33b1-88cc-17445faf60d7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Division dans une espèce",
                        "target_lang_word": "subespecie",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "subespecie",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab15ba34-2b25-3d96-967d-c0b130350c57",
                                        "entry_id": "f0d12e88-8695-3d50-beef-212599446159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Categoría infraespecífica, cada uno de los grupos en que se dividen las especies, y que se componen de individuos que, además de los caracteres propios de la misma, tienen en común otros caracteres morfológicos por los cuales se asemejan entre sí y se distinguen de los de las demás subespecies. Desde el punto de vista estrictamente sistemático o de la taxonomía, es la categoría taxonómica comprendida entre la especie y la raza."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
